 "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >《Staffer Retro - 异能追忆》是一款推理冒险游戏，探索与超能力相关的往事吧。</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >法力现象（即异能）是该系列的核心，贯穿故事始终。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >与薇莉塔一同踏上旅程，追寻法力的过往。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >玩家的推理将决定每一章的结局。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837350/extras/964a30bd9ea358ddec762f02b71cabf7.avif?t=1788402813\" width=800 height=269 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >跟随流程找到超能力相关的文档，以及留有痕迹的地图。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >整理文档信息，逐步揭开尘封于过往的真相。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837350/extras/64e7af7e3409e640588d7c816ec529b5.avif?t=1788402813\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【选择行动】</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >通过对话或探索来收集信息与文档，再逐步推理，得出只属于你自己的结论。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >根据你的选择和推理结果，故事将迎来不同的结局。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837350/extras/c910c35f377a9a5d2b9f32f9b282be7a.avif?t=1788402813\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837350/extras_big/c910c35f377a9a5d2b9f32f9b282be7a.webp?t=1788402813 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【组合文档进行推理】</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >本作也采用了异能系列特有的系统——基于文档进行推理！在大量记载着超能力相关信息的文档中组合线索，逐步揭开新的真相。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837350/extras/8b346d9f5b0e30cb260cdf6a475e4520.avif?t=1788402813\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837350/extras_big/8b346d9f5b0e30cb260cdf6a475e4520.webp?t=1788402813 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Re:Story】</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >从6种不同类型的文档中找出散落的线索。梳理完成后，幕后的真相或许就会浮现。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837350/extras/83225c66ce4446425ac4d24b8a731f19.avif?t=1788402813\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837350/extras_big/83225c66ce4446425ac4d24b8a731f19.webp?t=1788402813 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Retro系统】</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;在平静日常的另一面，隐藏着残酷的真相……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每个谜团也是如此，同样存在着“另一面”。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >颠覆现有的结论，发现全新的结局。&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837350/extras/3b6d49fa01a94d81d2741fb0866e8d5a.avif?t=1788402813\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*本游戏的所有内容均可自由直播。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*本游戏的制作过程中完全未使用生成式AI。</p>",
 "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >《Staffer Retro - 异能追忆》是一款推理冒险游戏，探索与超能力相关的往事吧。</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >法力现象（即异能）是该系列的核心，贯穿故事始终。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >与薇莉塔一同踏上旅程，追寻法力的过往。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >玩家的推理将决定每一章的结局。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837350/extras/964a30bd9ea358ddec762f02b71cabf7.avif?t=1788402813\" width=800 height=269 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >跟随流程找到超能力相关的文档，以及留有痕迹的地图。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >整理文档信息，逐步揭开尘封于过往的真相。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837350/extras/64e7af7e3409e640588d7c816ec529b5.avif?t=1788402813\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【选择行动】</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >通过对话或探索来收集信息与文档，再逐步推理，得出只属于你自己的结论。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >根据你的选择和推理结果，故事将迎来不同的结局。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837350/extras/c910c35f377a9a5d2b9f32f9b282be7a.avif?t=1788402813\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837350/extras_big/c910c35f377a9a5d2b9f32f9b282be7a.webp?t=1788402813 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【组合文档进行推理】</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >本作也采用了异能系列特有的系统——基于文档进行推理！在大量记载着超能力相关信息的文档中组合线索，逐步揭开新的真相。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837350/extras/8b346d9f5b0e30cb260cdf6a475e4520.avif?t=1788402813\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837350/extras_big/8b346d9f5b0e30cb260cdf6a475e4520.webp?t=1788402813 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Re:Story】</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >从6种不同类型的文档中找出散落的线索。梳理完成后，幕后的真相或许就会浮现。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837350/extras/83225c66ce4446425ac4d24b8a731f19.avif?t=1788402813\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837350/extras_big/83225c66ce4446425ac4d24b8a731f19.webp?t=1788402813 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Retro系统】</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;在平静日常的另一面，隐藏着残酷的真相……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每个谜团也是如此，同样存在着“另一面”。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >颠覆现有的结论，发现全新的结局。&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837350/extras/3b6d49fa01a94d81d2741fb0866e8d5a.avif?t=1788402813\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*本游戏的所有内容均可自由直播。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*本游戏的制作过程中完全未使用生成式AI。</p>",
 "short_description": "《Staffer Retro - 异能追忆》是一款推理冒险游戏，你将揭开法力的过往，追溯超能力的起源。通过对话和探索收集信息，从档案中找出线索拼凑真相，一步步引导主角薇莉塔·雷切尔做出选择。你的推理将决定故事走向！",
